<title>USA: Liz Claiborne to license swimwear to Sirena.</title>
<headline>Liz Claiborne to license swimwear to Sirena.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liz Claiborne Inc said on Wednesday it agreed to license a new swimwear business to Sirena Apparel Group Inc, under the Liz Claiborne and Elisabeth labels.</p>
<p>The Cruise '98 collections would be launched to the trade in June, the company said.</p>
<p>Sirena makes and markets swimwear under the Sirena Concepts, Sirena Signatures, Anne Klein, Rose Marie Reid, Look &amp; Sea, Hot Water and Wearabouts labels.</p>
